color:red;text-transform:uppercase'>сутра
ледоруба</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;text-transform:
uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Б.Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Каподастр
на 2-м ладу<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Вступление</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: C Am - 4p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span>Am<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span>Am<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Это
не песня - это
шаг вброд,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Шашка
<span class="SpellE">мескалина</span>,
вересковый
мед,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Это
сутра
ледоруба - <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       
</span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span>C<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Чтобы
вновь было
слово, чтобы
тронулся лед,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Вера
и надежда
лязгают
зубами в
кустах - <span class="SpellE">харе-харе</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> </span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>- 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Её
не нужно
будет
слушать, не
нужно будет
ждать,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Не
нужно
репетировать,
не нужно писать,
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Ей
не нужно
делать
мастер - <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Она
мать всех
слов, сама
себе мастер.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Белая
кобыла точет
копыта и ждёт
- <span class="SpellE">харе-харе</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: C Am - 4p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                                     
</span>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Дети
пепси-колы
заслуженно
отходят ко
сну,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Dm<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>А
осень
патриарха
длится так
долго, <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span></span><span style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Что
рискует
превратиться
в весну. <span class="SpellE">Хэй</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>. </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm F C Am C Am, G Dm F<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C Am </span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>- 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Так
что это не
песня, это
шаг <span class="GramE">в брод</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Шашка
<span class="SpellE">мескалина</span>,
движущийся
лед,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Это
новый снег на
губы,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Это
месть
партизана,
сутра
ледоруба,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span class="SpellE"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Аста</span></span><span style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> <span class="SpellE">маньяна</span>,
мы движемся
теперь на
восход <span class="SpellE">Хэй</span>,
<span class="SpellE">харе-харе</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'> - 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>И
вот летят
наши души, <o:p></o:p></span></p>
